  m_Name: PangolinZilant
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  creatureName: Pangolin Zilant
  description: 'The pangolin zilant is an aquatic burrowing zilant. It will curl
    into a protective ball and use its keratin scales to shield and hide itself from
    predators. This creature is a gentle giant who uses its huge claws to dig and
    mark territory instead of hunt or fight. The pangolin zilant also boasts a prehensile
    tail, which it uses mostly to swim more efficiently.

'
